<title>USA: USDA announces CCC lending rates for August.</title>
<headline>USDA announces CCC lending rates for August.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Thursday said the interest rate for 1996 crop year commodity loans would be 6.625 percent during August and rate for 1995 and prior year loans would be 5.625 percent.</p>
<p>Both rates are down slightly from July.</p>
<p>The loans are disbursed by USDA's Commodity Credit Corp.</p>
